// 验收场景（B0 #11）：全部数据由本文件自己生成，不含游戏内容；走生产的 NVN 录制入口与 Metal 回放，期望值手算。
// 三段：1) 资源/状态——带行距的缓冲→贴图上传与贴图→缓冲读回，逐纹素期望；2) 提交/生命周期——事件值只在 GPU 完成后可见、
// 贴图销毁后同址新贴图没有旧内容；3) 呈现——清色后按整帧裁切呈现，逐像素期望。
// 与 t_nvn / t_present_crop 的分工：那两支测 API 面与裁切数学；本支是一条完整「上传→提交→读回→呈现」验收链，
// 供 Vulkan 后端（#13 资源、#18 提交/呈现）逐项对照，数值与像素期望都由公式给出，不借被测实现。
// Acceptance scenes (B0 #11): every byte is generated by this file, no game content; they go through the production NVN
// recording entries and the Metal replay, with hand-computed expectations.
// Three scenes: 1) resources/state - buffer->texture upload and texture->buffer readback with row strides, per-texel
// expectations; 2) submission/lifetime - an event value becomes visible only after the GPU finished, and a new texture at
// the same address after finalize shows no old contents; 3) presentation - clear, then present a whole-frame crop, per-pixel
// expectations.
// Division of labour with t_nvn / t_present_crop: those two cover the API surface and the crop math; this one is a complete
// upload -> submit -> readback -> present acceptance chain, meant to be checked item by item by the Vulkan backend
// (#13 resources, #18 submit/present). All numeric and pixel expectations come from formulas, not from the code under test.
#include "../nvn/nvn_mtl.m"
#include "../nvn/hle_nvn.c"
uint64_t g_t0_ns;   // 宿主 main.c 的进程起点（hle_nvn 逐帧 @t_s 用），单测替身 | process start time from host main.c (used by hle_nvn's per-frame @t_s); unit test stub
void *front_metal_layer(void) { return NULL; }
module_t *module_of(const void *p) { (void)p; return NULL; }
module_t g_mod[MAX_MOD]; int g_nmod;
void svc_thread_dump(void) {}
uint64_t now_ns(void) { return bp_now(); }

static int cases, failed;
#define EXPECT(name, want, got) do { long long w_ = (long long)(want), g_ = (long long)(got); cases++; \
    printf("%-52s 期望 %-10lld → 真结果 %-10lld %s\n", name, w_, g_, w_ == g_ ? "✓" : "✗"); failed += w_ != g_; } while (0)

// 场景纹素公式：像素 (x,y) 的四个字节。期望由这条公式直接算，实现改不了它。
// Scene texel formula: the four bytes of pixel (x,y). Expectations are computed from this formula; the implementation cannot change it.
#define PX(x, y, c) ((uint8_t)((c) == 0 ? ((x) * 16 + (y)) : (c) == 1 ? ((y) * 16 + (x)) : (c) == 2 ? 0x55 : 0xAA))
static void fill_stage(uint8_t *stage, size_t row_bytes) {
    for (int y = 0; y < 4; y++) {
        for (int x = 0; x < 8; x++)
            for (int c = 0; c < 4; c++) stage[y * row_bytes + x * 4 + c] = PX(x, y, c);
        for (size_t i = 32; i < row_bytes; i++) stage[y * row_bytes + i] = 0xE7;   // 行尾填充：必须被行距跳过 | row padding: the row stride must skip it
    }
}
static int pattern_bad(const uint8_t *px, int w, int h, size_t row) {
    int bad = 0;
    for (int y = 0; y < h; y++)
        for (int x = 0; x < w; x++)
            for (int c = 0; c < 4; c++) bad += px[y * row + x * 4 + c] != PX(x, y, c);
    return bad;
}

int main(void) {
    NVNdeviceBuilder db; h_nvnDeviceBuilderSetDefaults(&db); h_nvnDeviceBuilderSetFlags(&db, 0);
    NVNdevice dev; EXPECT("DeviceInitialize", 1, h_nvnDeviceInitialize(&dev, &db));

    // 内存池：命令内存、源数据、贴图存储、事件值、读回缓冲都在同一池里（GPU 地址 = CPU 地址）
    // Memory pool: command memory, source data, texture storage, event value and readback buffers all live in one pool (GPU address = CPU address)
    static uint8_t pool_mem[256 << 10] __attribute__((aligned(4096)));
    NVNmemoryPoolBuilder pb; h_nvnMemoryPoolBuilderSetDefaults(&pb); h_nvnMemoryPoolBuilderSetDevice(&pb, &dev);
    h_nvnMemoryPoolBuilderSetStorage(&pb, pool_mem, sizeof pool_mem);
    NVNmemoryPool pool; EXPECT("MemoryPoolInitialize", 1, h_nvnMemoryPoolInitialize(&pool, &pb));

    uint8_t *stage = pool_mem + 0x4000, *out = pool_mem + 0x8000;
    fill_stage(stage, 64);

    // 8×4 RGBA8 线性贴图；行距 64 > 紧排 32，上传必须按行距取源
    // 8x4 RGBA8 linear texture; row stride 64 > tight 32, so the upload must take the source at the row stride
    NVNtextureBuilder tb; h_nvnTextureBuilderSetDefaults(&tb); h_nvnTextureBuilderSetDevice(&tb, &dev);
    h_nvnTextureBuilderSetTarget(&tb, NVN_TEXTURE_TARGET_2D);
    h_nvnTextureBuilderSetWidth(&tb, 8); h_nvnTextureBuilderSetHeight(&tb, 4);
    h_nvnTextureBuilderSetFormat(&tb, NVN_FORMAT_RGBA8);
    h_nvnTextureBuilderSetFlags(&tb, NVN_TEXTURE_FLAGS_LINEAR);
    h_nvnTextureBuilderSetStorage(&tb, &pool, 0x1000);
    NVNtexture tex; EXPECT("TextureInitialize", 1, h_nvnTextureInitialize(&tex, &tb));
    EXPECT("线性 8×4 RGBA8 存储尺寸（行距 32 对齐 32）", 32 * 4, h_nvnTextureGetStorageSize(&tex));

    NVNeventBuilder eb; h_nvnEventBuilderSetDefaults(&eb); h_nvnEventBuilderSetStorage(&eb, &pool, 0xC000);
    NVNevent ev; EXPECT("EventInitialize", 1, h_nvnEventInitialize(&ev, &eb));

    NVNcommandBuffer cb; h_nvnCommandBufferInitialize(&cb, &dev);
    h_nvnCommandBufferAddCommandMemory(&cb, &pool, 0x10000, 0x8000);
    h_nvnCommandBufferBeginRecording(&cb);
    NVNcopyRegion r = {0, 0, 0, 8, 4, 1};
    h_nvnCommandBufferSetCopyRowStride(&cb, 64);
    h_nvnCommandBufferCopyBufferToTexture(&cb, (NVNbufferAddress)stage, &tex, NULL, &r, 0);
    h_nvnCommandBufferSignalEvent(&cb, &ev, NVN_EVENT_SIGNAL_MODE_WRITE, NVN_EVENT_SIGNAL_LOCATION_BOTTOM, 0, 0x2A);
    NVNcommandHandle h1 = h_nvnCommandBufferEndRecording(&cb);

    // 负对照：提交前事件值不在 CPU 侧出现 | Negative control: the event value must not appear on the CPU side before submit
    EXPECT("提交前事件值为 0", 0, h_nvnEventGetValue(&ev));

    NVNqueueBuilder qb; h_nvnQueueBuilderSetDefaults(&qb); h_nvnQueueBuilderSetDevice(&qb, &dev);
    static uint8_t qmem[1 << 19];
    size_t qsz = h_nvnQueueBuilderGetQueueMemorySize(&qb);
    h_nvnQueueBuilderSetQueueMemory(&qb, qmem, qsz);
    NVNqueue q; EXPECT("QueueInitialize", 1, h_nvnQueueInitialize(&q, &qb));
    NVNsync fence; h_nvnSyncInitialize(&fence, &dev);
    h_nvnQueueSubmitCommands(&q, 1, &h1);
    h_nvnQueueFenceSync(&q, &fence, NVN_SYNC_CONDITION_ALL_GPU_COMMANDS_COMPLETE, 0);
    EXPECT("围栏等待满足", 1, h_nvnSyncWait(&fence, 5000000000ull));

    // 场景 1：上传按行距 64 取源，读回逐纹素等于公式
    // Scene 1: the upload takes the source at row stride 64; the readback equals the formula texel by texel
    h_nvnTextureReadTexels(&tex, NULL, &r, out);
    EXPECT("8×4 逐纹素等于公式（行距 64 的源）", 0, pattern_bad(out, 8, 4, 32));
    EXPECT("事件值在 GPU 完成后 = 0x2A", 0x2A, h_nvnEventGetValue(&ev));

    // 场景 1b：贴图→缓冲回写，行距 48；行尾 16 字节保持哨兵值
    // Scene 1b: texture->buffer writeback at row stride 48; the trailing 16 bytes of each row keep the sentinel value
    uint8_t *back = pool_mem + 0xD000;
    memset(back, 0x5C, 48 * 4);
    h_nvnCommandBufferBeginRecording(&cb);
    h_nvnCommandBufferSetCopyRowStride(&cb, 48);
    h_nvnCommandBufferCopyTextureToBuffer(&cb, &tex, NULL, &r, (NVNbufferAddress)back, 0);
    NVNcommandHandle h2 = h_nvnCommandBufferEndRecording(&cb);
    NVNsync fence2; h_nvnSyncInitialize(&fence2, &dev);
    h_nvnQueueSubmitCommands(&q, 1, &h2);
    h_nvnQueueFenceSync(&q, &fence2, NVN_SYNC_CONDITION_ALL_GPU_COMMANDS_COMPLETE, 0);
    EXPECT("回写围栏等待满足", 1, h_nvnSyncWait(&fence2, 5000000000ull));
    EXPECT("8×4 逐纹素回写等于公式（目标行距 48）", 0, pattern_bad(back, 8, 4, 48));
    int pad_ok = 1;
    for (int y = 0; y < 4; y++) for (size_t i = 32; i < 48; i++) pad_ok &= back[y * 48 + i] == 0x5C;
    EXPECT("回写不碰行尾填充（16 字节 × 4 行）", 1, pad_ok);

    // 场景 2：贴图销毁后同址重建，新贴图读回不出现旧内容（生命周期/别名）
    // Scene 2: after finalize, a texture rebuilt at the same address must not read back old contents (lifetime/aliasing)
    h_nvnTextureFinalize(&tex);
    memset(out, 0, 8 * 4 * 4);
    NVNtexture tex2; h_nvnTextureBuilderSetStorage(&tb, &pool, 0x1000);
    EXPECT("同址重建 TextureInitialize", 1, h_nvnTextureInitialize(&tex2, &tb));
    NVNtexture tex3;   // 场景 3 的第二张源贴图（声明在外，便于末尾统一销毁） | second source texture of Scene 3 (declared here so cleanup can see it)
    NVNsync fence4;    // 场景 3 第二帧的清色围栏 | clear fence of the second Scene 3 frame
    h_nvnCommandBufferBeginRecording(&cb);
    h_nvnCommandBufferSetCopyRowStride(&cb, 0);                       // 0 = 紧排 | 0 = tight packing
    // 浮点清色：0 / 1 / 0.5 / 0.25 落进 RGBA8 的字节是 0 / 255 / 128 / 64（0.5×255 = 127.5 取 128，0.25×255 = 63.75 取 64）
    // Float clear: 0 / 1 / 0.5 / 0.25 land in RGBA8 bytes as 0 / 255 / 128 / 64 (0.5x255 = 127.5 gives 128, 0.25x255 = 63.75 gives 64)
    h_nvnCommandBufferClearTexture(&cb, &tex2, NULL, &r, (const float[]){0.0f, 1.0f, 0.5f, 0.25f}, 0xF);
    NVNcommandHandle h3 = h_nvnCommandBufferEndRecording(&cb);
    NVNsync fence3; h_nvnSyncInitialize(&fence3, &dev);
    h_nvnQueueSubmitCommands(&q, 1, &h3);
    h_nvnQueueFenceSync(&q, &fence3, NVN_SYNC_CONDITION_ALL_GPU_COMMANDS_COMPLETE, 0);
    EXPECT("清色围栏等待满足", 1, h_nvnSyncWait(&fence3, 5000000000ull));
    h_nvnTextureReadTexels(&tex2, NULL, &r, out);
    int clear_bad = 0;
    for (int i = 0; i < 32; i++) {
        static const uint8_t want[4] = {0, 255, 128, 64};
        clear_bad += memcmp(out + i * 4, want, 4) != 0;
    }
    EXPECT("同址新贴图 32 纹素全等于清色值", 0, clear_bad);

    // 场景 3：呈现——两次整帧呈现到同一 8×4 目标：第二帧换一张源贴图、换一组清色值，
    // 32 个像素必须全部变成第二帧的期望；只复用首帧的呈现器会在这里被抓到。
    // Scene 3: presentation - two whole-frame presents into the same 8x4 target: the second frame uses a different
    // source texture and a different clear value, so all 32 pixels must change to the second expectation; a presenter
    // that keeps returning its first frame fails here.
    {
        MTLTextureDescriptor *d = [MTLTextureDescriptor texture2DDescriptorWithPixelFormat:MTLPixelFormatRGBA8Unorm
                                                                                    width:8 height:4 mipmapped:NO];
        d.usage = MTLTextureUsageRenderTarget; d.storageMode = MTLStorageModeShared;
        id<MTLTexture> dst = [g_dev newTextureWithDescriptor:d];
        uint8_t *px = malloc(8 * 4 * 4);
        static const uint8_t want1[4] = {0, 255, 128, 64};      // 清色值 A：0 / 1 / 0.5 / 0.25 | clear value A
        static const uint8_t want2[4] = {255, 64, 0, 128};      // 清色值 B：1 / 0.25 / 0 / 0.5 | clear value B

        // 第一帧：已清成 A 的 tex2 | First frame: tex2, already cleared to A
        id<MTLCommandBuffer> mcb1 = [g_q commandBuffer];
        EXPECT("第一帧呈现编码成功（整帧）", 1, present_encode(mcb1, tex_mtl(&tex2), dst, NULL));
        [mcb1 commit]; [mcb1 waitUntilCompleted];
        EXPECT("第一帧呈现 GPU 完成", MTLCommandBufferStatusCompleted, mcb1.status);
        [dst getBytes:px bytesPerRow:32 fromRegion:MTLRegionMake2D(0, 0, 8, 4) mipmapLevel:0];
        int bad1 = 0; for (int i = 0; i < 32; i++) bad1 += memcmp(px + i * 4, want1, 4) != 0;
        EXPECT("第一帧 32 像素全等于清色值 A", 0, bad1);

        // 第二帧的源：同一池另一偏移，清成 B | Source of the second frame: another offset in the same pool, cleared to B
        h_nvnTextureBuilderSetStorage(&tb, &pool, 0x2000);
        EXPECT("第二帧源贴图初始化", 1, h_nvnTextureInitialize(&tex3, &tb));
        h_nvnCommandBufferBeginRecording(&cb);
        h_nvnCommandBufferClearTexture(&cb, &tex3, NULL, &r, (const float[]){1.0f, 0.25f, 0.0f, 0.5f}, 0xF);
        NVNcommandHandle h4 = h_nvnCommandBufferEndRecording(&cb);
        h_nvnSyncInitialize(&fence4, &dev);
        h_nvnQueueSubmitCommands(&q, 1, &h4);
        h_nvnQueueFenceSync(&q, &fence4, NVN_SYNC_CONDITION_ALL_GPU_COMMANDS_COMPLETE, 0);
        EXPECT("第二帧源清色围栏等待满足", 1, h_nvnSyncWait(&fence4, 5000000000ull));

        id<MTLCommandBuffer> mcb2 = [g_q commandBuffer];
        EXPECT("第二帧呈现编码成功（整帧，同一目标）", 1, present_encode(mcb2, tex_mtl(&tex3), dst, NULL));
        [mcb2 commit]; [mcb2 waitUntilCompleted];
        EXPECT("第二帧呈现 GPU 完成", MTLCommandBufferStatusCompleted, mcb2.status);
        [dst getBytes:px bytesPerRow:32 fromRegion:MTLRegionMake2D(0, 0, 8, 4) mipmapLevel:0];
        int bad2 = 0, stale = 0;
        for (int i = 0; i < 32; i++) {
            bad2 += memcmp(px + i * 4, want2, 4) != 0;            // 必须是 B | must be B
            stale += memcmp(px + i * 4, want1, 4) == 0;           // 不能还是 A | must not still be A
        }
        EXPECT("第二帧 32 像素全等于清色值 B", 0, bad2);
        EXPECT("第二帧没有任何像素仍是首帧的值（未复用首帧）", 0, stale);
        free(px);
    }

    // 全程不得有报红 | Nothing may report red during the whole run
    int reds = 0; for (int i = 0; i < 64; i++) reds += g_red_once[i] != 0;
    EXPECT("全程无【红】", 0, reds);

    // 资源生命周期：本夹具创建的对象按「贴图 → 事件 / 同步 → 命令缓冲 / 队列 → 池 → 设备」顺序销毁。
    // 池必须最后于引用其内存的对象（贴图的 MTLTexture 引用池缓冲）；没有刻意留到进程退出的对象。
    // Resource lifetime: objects created by this fixture are destroyed in the order textures -> event/syncs ->
    // command buffer/queue -> pool -> device. The pool must come after everything that references its memory (a
    // texture's MTLTexture references the pool buffer). Nothing is intentionally left to process exit.
    h_nvnTextureFinalize(&tex2);
    h_nvnTextureFinalize(&tex3);
    h_nvnEventFinalize(&ev);
    h_nvnSyncFinalize(&fence);
    h_nvnSyncFinalize(&fence2);
    h_nvnSyncFinalize(&fence3);
    h_nvnSyncFinalize(&fence4);
    h_nvnCommandBufferFinalize(&cb);
    h_nvnQueueFinalize(&q);
    h_nvnMemoryPoolFinalize(&pool);
    h_nvnDeviceFinalize(&dev);
    printf("== %d 项，失败 %d ==\n", cases, failed);
    return failed != 0;
}
